sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as React console (Review)
  participant API as FastAPI decision routes
  participant Repo as WatchlistRepository
  participant DB as Database
  Op->>UI: Open Review
  UI->>API: GET /api/decisions
  API->>Repo: pending_decisions()
  Repo->>DB: Query PENDING decisions
  API-->>UI: Cards with weights and not-counted reasons
  UI->>API: GET evidence crop and enrolment photo
  API-->>UI: Decrypted images
  Op->>UI: Compare the two images, add an optional note
  alt Confirm identification
    UI->>API: POST /api/decisions/id/review with confirmed
  else Not this person
    UI->>API: POST /api/decisions/id/review with rejected
  end
  API->>API: Take the operator from the signed-in session
  API->>Repo: review(decision, operator, verdict, note)
  Repo->>DB: Add DecisionReview row and update status
  Repo->>DB: Write audit event
  API-->>UI: Updated decision
  UI-->>Op: Card leaves the queue
